#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA = clean edges at the game's render size. DLSS = the same, and it upscales when the game's "
"Scaling is below 100 %. off = the game's own picture: use it to compare. Saved at once."
msgstr ""
"DLAA = rena kanter i spelets renderstorlek. DLSS = samma sak, och uppskalar när spelets Skalning "
"är under 100 %. av = spelets egen bild: för jämförelse. Sparas direkt."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Presets for your GPU. high = everything on (model 1). medium = model 2, half-size see-through "
"depth, flat mirrors without part motion, lighter part-motion search. low = also no mirror DLAA, "
"no see-through depth, VR area 60 %. Never changes a setting you set yourself."
msgstr ""
"Förinställningar för din GPU. hög = allt på (modell 1). medel = modell 2, halvt genomskinligt "
"djup, platta speglar utan delrörelse, lättare sökning. låg = också ingen spegel-DLAA, inget "
"genomskinligt djup, VR-yta 60 %. Ändrar aldrig något du ställt in själv."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"1 (K) = most detail, sharpest text, about 1.6x the GPU of 2. 2 (E) = balanced, least ghosting "
"behind traffic: start here. 3 (F) = calmest on fences and wires, can smear moving detail, same "
"cost as 2. 4 (M) = heaviest (about 5x), flat tests only."
msgstr ""
"1 (K) = mest detaljer, skarpast text, ca 1,6x GPU av 2. 2 (E) = balanserad, minst spökbilder "
"bakom trafik: börja här. 3 (F) = lugnast vid staket och ledningar, kan smeta rörliga detaljer, "
"samma kostnad som 2. 4 (M) = tyngst (ca 5x), endast för platta tester."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Picture quality: sharpening, texture sharpness, the DLAA area and the see-through depth. Right "
"opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Bildkvalitet: skärpning, texturskärpa, DLAA-ytan och genomskinligt djup. Höger öppnar gruppen, "
"vänster stänger den; den är stängd varje gång menyn öppnas."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharpens the picture after DLAA, 0 (off) to 1.0. Raise it if the picture looks soft; too high "
"gives bright halos on edges. Costs about 0.1 ms; 0 skips the pass."
msgstr ""
"Skärper bilden efter DLAA, 0 (av) till 1,0. Höj om bilden är mjuk; för högt ger ljusa kanter. "
"Kostar ca 0,1 ms; 0 hoppar över steget."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far the sharpening reaches, 1 to 4 px: small = fine detail, large = bolder edges. Change it "
"if the sharpening looks too fine or too coarse; a picture drawn larger than the screen, as in VR, "
"needs more than 1 px."
msgstr ""
"Skärpningens räckvidd, 1 till 4 px: litet = fina detaljer, stort = kraftigare kanter. Ändra om "
"den känns för fin eller grov; en bild större än skärmen (VR) behöver mer än 1 px."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharper texture text (road signs, dashboard, GPS). 0 = off; more negative = sharper but more "
"shimmer on fences; try -0.5 to -1 if text is blurry. No GPU time, only a little memory bandwidth."
msgstr ""
"Skarpare text i texturer (skyltar, instrumentpanel, GPS). 0 = av; mer negativ = skarpare men mer "
"flimmer på staket; prova -0,5 till -1 vid suddig text. Ingen GPU-tid, bara lite minnesbandbredd."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The same for wire fences, grass and leaf cut-outs: raise it toward 0 if fences shimmer, lower it "
"if grass looks soft. same = follows the row above. Acts only while Texture sharpness is not 0. No "
"GPU time, a little memory."
msgstr ""
"Samma för nätstaket, gräs och bladutklipp: höj mot 0 om staket flimrar, sänk om gräs är mjukt. "
"samma = följer raden ovan. Verkar bara när Texturskärpa inte är 0. Ingen GPU-tid, lite minne."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR: only the middle of each eye gets DLAA (20 to 100 %); the edge keeps the game's picture. Lower "
"it to afford a heavier model or win frame rate; 40 % costs about 40 % of the model. Also sets the "
"garage / main-menu truck."
msgstr ""
"VR: bara mitten av varje öga får DLAA (20 till 100 %); kanten behåller spelets bild. Sänk för en "
"tyngre modell eller fler fps; 40 % kostar ca 40 % av modellen. Gäller även "
"garage-/huvudmenylastbilen."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only: DLAA before the game's bloom / tonemap, so lane paint, wires and rails shimmer less. "
"Change it only to compare. Not used with DLSS upscale or Windows HDR. Same cost either way; takes "
"~60 frames to switch."
msgstr ""
"Endast plattskärm: DLAA före spelets bloom/tonemap, så vägmarkeringar, ledningar och räls flimrar "
"mindre. Ändra bara för jämförelse. Inte med DLSS-uppskalning eller Windows-HDR. Samma kostnad; "
"bytet tar ~60 bildrutor."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives wires, fences and glass their own distance instead of what is behind them, so they do not "
"smear when you move. Turn it off if you see no smearing there: saves 0.02 - 0.06 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Ger ledningar, staket och glas eget avstånd i stället för det bakom, så de inte smetar vid "
"rörelse. Stäng av om inget smetar: sparar 0,02 - 0,06 ms per öga."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Stops street-lamp and car-light glows leaving a trail behind them when you move: DLSS takes each "
"glow from the current frame, not its history. 25 % steps; lower it if lamp glows flicker, 0 = "
"off. Costs about 0.05 - 0.2 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Hindrar att glöd från gatlyktor och bilbelysning drar ett spår vid rörelse: DLSS tar varje glöd "
"från aktuell bild, inte historiken. Steg om 25 %; sänk om glöden flimrar, 0 = av. Kostar ca 0,05 "
"- 0,2 ms per öga."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How moving parts and truck mirrors are handled by DLAA. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it "
"starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Hur DLAA hanterar rörliga delar och lastbilsspeglar. Höger öppnar gruppen, vänster stänger den; "
"den är stängd varje gång menyn öppnas."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives each moving part (traffic, wheels, plates) its own motion for DLAA, so it stays sharp and "
"does not ghost. Turn it off only to save about 0.5 ms per eye or to test: every pixel then moves "
"with the camera and traffic smears."
msgstr ""
"Ger varje rörlig del (trafik, hjul, registreringsskyltar) egen rörelse för DLAA, så den förblir "
"skarp utan spökbilder. Stäng bara av för att spara ca 0,5 ms per öga eller testa: varje pixel "
"följer då kameran och trafik smetar."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives truck mirrors their own DLAA so they do not shimmer. 1 mirror = only the largest (the main "
"mirror next to you). all = every mirror. camera = cheapest per mirror, moving traffic can ghost "
"in the glass; else each part moves exactly in the glass."
msgstr ""
"Ger lastbilsspeglar eget DLAA så de inte flimrar. 1 spegel = bara den största (huvudspegeln "
"bredvid dig). alla = varje spegel. kamera = billigast per spegel, trafik kan spöka i glaset; "
"annars rör sig varje del exakt i glaset."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = each mirror gets its DLAA every 2nd frame and shows its last clean picture in between: about "
"half the mirror cost. Edges stay clean; moving things in the glass update at half rate. off = "
"every mirror every frame."
msgstr ""
"på = varje spegel får sitt DLAA var 2:a bildruta och visar sin senaste rena bild emellan: ca "
"halva spegelkostnaden. Kanter förblir rena; rörelse i glaset uppdateras med halv hastighet. av = "
"varje spegel varje bildruta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires keep their motion while you drive: DLAA spreads the motion data over thin lines (DLSS "
"motion dilation). on = default. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more. The picture is "
"soft for a moment when it changes."
msgstr ""
"Tunna ledningar behåller sin rörelse under körning: DLAA sprider rörelsedata över tunna linjer "
"(DLSS motion dilation). på = standard. av = bara för jämförelse; nära ledningar flimrar mer. "
"Bilden är kort mjuk vid byte."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires get depth on every pixel they touch, not only where they cover a pixel centre. on = "
"default. on (no A2C) = also for see-through edges. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more."
msgstr ""
"Tunna ledningar får djup på varje pixel de rör, inte bara där de täcker en pixelmitt. på = "
"standard. på (utan A2C) = även för genomskinliga kanter. av = bara för jämförelse; nära ledningar "
"flimrar mer."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental: draws far wires that are thinner than 1 pixel as a 1 pixel line, so they do not "
"break into dashes. Off by default: far wires may look darker or flicker more. Try it and compare."
msgstr ""
"Experimentellt: ritar avlägsna ledningar tunnare än 1 pixel som en linje på 1 pixel, så de inte "
"bryts i streck. Av som standard: avlägsna ledningar kan se mörkare ut eller flimra mer. Prova och "
"jämför."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLSS upscale, the DLAA on / off switch and the OFXR Bridge / VectorXR info. Right opens the "
"group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"DLSS-uppskalning, DLAA-strömbrytaren och info om OFXR Bridge / VectorXR. Höger öppnar gruppen, "
"vänster stänger den; den är stängd varje gång menyn öppnas."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLSS draws the picture back up to full size when the game's Scaling is below 100 %: sharper than "
"the game's own stretch, and fewer pixels drawn means more fps. No extra cost; does nothing at "
"Scaling 100 %."
msgstr ""
"DLSS ritar bilden tillbaka i full storlek när spelets Skalning är under 100 %: skarpare än "
"spelets egen sträckning, och färre pixlar ger fler fps. Ingen extra kostnad; gör inget vid "
"Skalning 100 %."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches the whole mod on or off and keeps the mode; off shows the game's own picture, for "
"comparing. Off saves the cost of every part together."
msgstr ""
"Slår på eller av hela modden och minns läget; av visar spelets egen bild för jämförelse. Av "
"sparar kostnaden för alla delar tillsammans."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR frame generation by djules75, a separate download "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). found = its layer is loaded in this game and the mod lets its "
"work pass through. Start its tray app before the game."
msgstr ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR-framegenerering av djules75, en separat nedladdning "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). hittad = lagret är laddat i spelet och modden släpper igenom "
"dess arbete. Starta dess tray-app före spelet."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VectorXR = an OpenXR enhancement suite by DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"Depth, frame generation; found = its layer is loaded in the game and the mod lets its work pass "
"through. Run only one Turbo (its or the mod's)."
msgstr ""
"VectorXR = en OpenXR-förbättringssvit av DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"djup, framegenerering; hittad = lagret är laddat i spelet och modden släpper igenom dess arbete. "
"Använd bara en Turbo (dess eller moddens)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR speed-ups: Turbo, foveated rendering and the hidden area mask. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"VR-snabbare: Turbo, foveated rendering och masken för dolt område. Höger öppnar gruppen, vänster "
"stänger den; den är stängd varje gång menyn öppnas."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Turbo: no ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW / reprojection. VR only. On = the game stops waiting for "
"the headset each frame: more fps only when the CPU is the limit (busy cities, traffic). Turn it "
"off if the picture judders. From OpenXR Toolkit."
msgstr ""
"Turbo: ingen ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW / reprojektion. Endast VR. På = spelet väntar inte på "
"headsetet varje bildruta: fler fps bara när CPU är gränsen (trånga städer, trafik). Av om bilden "
"hackar. Från OpenXR Toolkit."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharp centre, lower detail at the edge (NVIDIA RTX only). Saves GPU time at high Scaling. VR "
"only. The outer ring is shaded once per 2 x 2 pixels; fences, grass and leaves keep full detail. "
"Turn it off if the edge looks blocky."
msgstr ""
"Skarpt centrum, mindre detalj i kanten (endast NVIDIA RTX). Sparar GPU-tid vid hög Skalning. "
"Endast VR. Yttre ringen skuggas en gång per 2 x 2 pixlar; staket, gräs och löv behåller full "
"detalj. Av om kanten ser blockig ut."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How big the sharp centre of Foveated (VRS) is, 10 - 100 % in 5 % steps: bigger = more of the view "
"sharp, less saving; smaller = more saving, lower detail starts closer to the middle. 80 % "
"(balanced) is the default; 90 = wide, 65 = narrow."
msgstr ""
"Hur stort det skarpa centret i Foveated (VRS) är, 10 - 100 % i steg om 5 %: större = mer av "
"synfältet skarpt, mindre besparing; mindre = mer besparing, lägre detalj börjar närmare mitten. "
"80 % (balanserad) är standard; 90 = bred, 65 = smal."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Which of the game's passes Foveated (VRS) acts on. scene = the 3D world only (default). scene + "
"lighting = also the game's lighting pass, at the very edge only: more saving. Test it: look for "
"blocky light or shadow edges at the side of your view."
msgstr ""
"Vilka av spelets renderpass Foveated (VRS) verkar på. scen = bara 3D-världen (standard). scen + "
"ljus = även ljuspasset, bara längst ut: mer besparing. Testa: titta efter blockiga ljus- eller "
"skuggkanter i sidan av synfältet."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How coarse the outer ring of Foveated (VRS) is. Normal = 1 colour per 2 x 2 pixels (default). "
"Strong = per 4 x 2, Max = per 4 x 4: more GPU saving, blockier edges. Best with eye tracking, "
"where you never look at the outer ring."
msgstr ""
"Hur grov yttre ringen i Foveated (VRS) är. Normal = 1 färg per 2 x 2 pixlar (standard). Kraftig = "
"per 4 x 2, Max = per 4 x 4: mer GPU-besparing, blockigare kanter. Bäst med eyetracking, där du "
"aldrig tittar på yttre ringen."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental. The sharp centre of Foveated (VRS) follows your eyes on a headset with eye tracking "
"(OpenXR eye gaze, for example Varjo); without one it stays at the lens centre. Needs Foveated "
"(VRS) on at the game's start, else a restart. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Experimentellt. Det skarpa centret i Foveated (VRS) följer dina ögon på ett headset med "
"eyetracking (OpenXR eye gaze, t.ex. Varjo); utan stannar det i linscentrum. Foveated (VRS) måste "
"vara på vid spelstart, annars omstart. Nästan ingen kostnad."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. The game skips the lens corners you never see (the headset reports them), so it draws "
"fewer pixels: more GPU headroom, the picture you see stays the same. The first switch-on needs a "
"game restart. Turn it off if the edge of the view looks wrong."
msgstr ""
"Endast VR. Spelet hoppar över linshörnen du aldrig ser (headsetet rapporterar dem) och ritar "
"färre pixlar: mer GPU-utrymme, bilden du ser är densamma. Första påslaget kräver omstart av "
"spelet. Av om synfältets kant ser fel ut."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Frame rate limits and CPU: NVIDIA Reflex and an FPS cap for flat, a VR FPS cap, CPU tuning. Right "
"opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Bildfrekvensgränser och CPU: NVIDIA Reflex och en fps-gräns för platt, en VR-fps-gräns, "
"CPU-tuning. Höger öppnar gruppen, vänster stänger den; den är stängd varje gång menyn öppnas."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only, NVIDIA only. On = the game's frames wait less in the GPU queue: less input lag when "
"the GPU is the limit. Boost also keeps the GPU clocks up. Same fps; small cost. Not used in VR."
msgstr ""
"Endast platt, endast NVIDIA. På = spelets bildrutor väntar mindre i GPU-kön: mindre "
"inputfördröjning när GPU är gränsen. Boost håller också GPU-klockorna uppe. Samma fps; liten "
"kostnad. Inte i VR."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only. Holds the game at most at this frame rate: a steady frame time, less heat and power. "
"Set it a bit below what your PC holds in a busy city. With Reflex on, the NVIDIA driver does the "
"limiting. off = no limit."
msgstr ""
"Endast platt. Håller spelet på högst denna bildfrekvens: jämn frametid, mindre värme och ström. "
"Sätt den lite under vad din dator klarar i en trång stad. Med Reflex på begränsar "
"NVIDIA-drivrutinen. av = ingen gräns."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. half = the game draws every 2nd headset frame (72 Hz -> 36 fps), third = every 3rd; the "
"headset's reprojection (ASW / Motion Smoothing) fills the rest at a steady rhythm. Use it when "
"the fps swings. Turns Turbo off while on."
msgstr ""
"Endast VR. halv = spelet ritar var 2:a headsetbildruta (72 Hz -> 36 fps), tredjedel = var 3:e; "
"headsetets reprojektion (ASW / Motion Smoothing) fyller i resten i jämn takt. Använd när fps "
"varierar. Stänger av Turbo medan det är på."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Three CPU switches together: the main and render thread prefer the P-cores (Intel hybrid CPUs "
"only), the game runs at Above normal priority, and Windows may not throttle it (EcoQoS) or ignore "
"its timer requests. Helps when the CPU is the limit; no cost. Separate settings in dlaa.ini: "
"cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."
msgstr ""
"Tre CPU-omkopplare tillsammans: huvud- och rendertråden föredrar P-cores (endast "
"Intel-hybrid-CPU:er), spelet körs med prioritet Över normal, och Windows får inte strypa det "
"(EcoQoS) eller ignorera dess timerförfrågningar. Hjälper när CPU är gränsen; ingen kostnad. "
"Separat i dlaa.ini: cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The panel's position, size, depth, facing and the menu keys. Right opens the group, Left closes "
"it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Panelens position, storlek, djup och riktning samt menytangenterna. Höger öppnar gruppen, vänster "
"stänger den; den är stängd varje gång menyn öppnas."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = the panel moves with the headset. Fixed in cab = it stays at one spot in "
"front of your seat, steady while you look around; X / Y / depth then set that spot (degrees, "
"metres). Needs the VR layer (default). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Endast VR. Följ huvud = panelen följer headsetet. Fast i hytten = den stannar på en plats framför "
"din stol, stadig när du ser dig om; X / Y / djup styr då platsen (grader, meter). Kräver "
"VR-lagret (standard). Ingen kostnad."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees around your seat). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Flyttar panelen i sidled, i % av skärmen (VR fast i hytten: grader runt din stol). Platt och VR "
"har var sin position. Använd om panelen täcker något du behöver. Ingen kostnad."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees, plus = down). Flat and "
"VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Flyttar panelen upp / ned, i % av skärmen (VR fast i hytten: grader, plus = ned). Platt och VR "
"har var sin position. Använd om panelen täcker något du behöver. Ingen kostnad."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes this panel bigger or smaller. Raise it if you cannot read it, lower it if it covers too "
"much. Flat and VR each keep their own size. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Gör panelen större eller mindre. Höj om du inte kan läsa den, sänk om den täcker för mycket. "
"Platt och VR har var sin storlek. Ingen kostnad."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the panel floats: in metres (0.30 - 3.00) as a VR layer, "
"the default; in px of inward shift per eye with menu_vr_layer = 0. Same size at every depth. "
"Change it if the panel is tiring to look at. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Endast VR, därför grå i platt. Hur långt bort panelen svävar: i meter (0,30 - 3,00) som VR-lager, "
"standard; i px inåtförskjutning per öga med menu_vr_layer = 0. Samma storlek på alla djup. Ändra "
"om panelen är tröttande att titta på. Ingen kostnad."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. On = the panel turns to face you when you move it to the side, same "
"size from every angle (as a VR layer, the default, the head-following fps box too); off = a flat "
"picture. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Endast VR, därför grå i platt. På = panelen vrider sig mot dig när du flyttar den åt sidan, samma "
"storlek från alla vinklar (som VR-lager, standard, även den huvudföljande fps-räknaren); av = en "
"platt bild. Ingen kostnad."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"A small live fps and frame-time box, also while this menu is closed (flat and VR). Use it to see "
"what a setting gains. Its GPU cost is measured: per frame, every picture it is drawn into; none "
"when off. Save keeps it for the next start."
msgstr ""
"En liten live-ruta med fps och frametid, även när menyn är stängd (platt och VR). Använd den för "
"att se vad en inställning ger. GPU-kostnaden är mätt: per bildruta, varje bild den ritas i; ingen "
"när av. Spara behåller den till nästa start."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The fps box's lock, position, size, colour, VR distance and turn. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Fps-räknarens lås, position, storlek, färg, VR-avstånd och vridning. Höger öppnar gruppen, "
"vänster stänger den; den är stängd varje gång menyn öppnas."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = moves with the headset. Fixed in play space = one spot around your seat, "
"ignores the cab's sway. Attached to vehicle = stuck to the cab, sways with it (needs DLAA + "
"Per-part motion vectors). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Endast VR. Följ huvud = följer headsetet. Fast i spelytan = en plats runt din stol, ignorerar "
"hyttens gungande. Fäst vid fordon = sitter på hytten, gungar med (kräver DLAA + rörelsevektorer "
"per del). Ingen kostnad."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. On = each truck / car keeps its own fps box spot in the cab, turn, "
"size, colour, brightness and text (saved in dlaa.ini when the menu closes). Off = one shared set "
"for every vehicle. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Endast VR, endast Fäst vid fordon. På = varje lastbil / bil behåller egen plats, vridning, "
"storlek, färg, ljusstyrka och text för fps-räknaren i hytten (sparas i dlaa.ini när menyn "
"stängs). Av = en gemensam uppsättning för alla fordon. Ingen kostnad."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. Right = measure the cab again now (sit still, parked) if the box "
"sits off. Left = this vehicle's box back to the defaults (spot, turn, size, colour, text); other "
"vehicles keep theirs. The box is square to the cab."
msgstr ""
"Endast VR, endast Fäst vid fordon. Höger = mät hytten igen nu (sitt still, parkerad) om rutan "
"sitter fel. Vänster = detta fordons ruta tillbaka till standard (plats, vridning, storlek, färg, "
"text); andra fordon behåller sina. Rutan står vinkelrätt mot hytten."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees around you). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Flyttar fps-räknaren i sidled, i % av skärmen (VR fast / fäst: grader runt dig). Platt och VR har "
"var sin position. Ingen kostnad."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees, minus = up). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Flyttar fps-räknaren upp / ned, i % av skärmen (VR fast / fäst: grader, minus = upp). Platt och "
"VR har var sin position. Ingen kostnad."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Turns the fps box left / right on itself, in degrees (+ = its face "
"turns to the right). Use it to angle the box when it sits at the side. 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Endast VR, därför grå i platt. Vrider fps-räknaren åt vänster / höger runt sig själv, i grader (+ "
"= framsidan vrids åt höger). Använd för att vinkla den när den sitter vid sidan. 0 = den vänder "
"mot dig. Ingen kostnad."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Tilts the fps box, in degrees (+ = its top leans away from you, as if "
"lying on the dashboard). 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Endast VR, därför grå i platt. Lutar fps-räknaren, i grader (+ = toppen lutar bort från dig, som "
"om den låg på instrumentpanelen). 0 = den vänder mot dig. Ingen kostnad."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Rotates the fps box in its own plane, in degrees (+ = clockwise). 0 = "
"upright. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Endast VR, därför grå i platt. Roterar fps-räknaren i sitt eget plan, i grader (+ = medurs). 0 = "
"upprätt. Ingen kostnad."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes the fps box bigger or smaller (0.2 .. 3.0). Raise it if you cannot read it in the headset "
"or on a big screen. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Gör fps-räknaren större eller mindre (0,2 .. 3,0). Höj om du inte kan läsa den i headsetet eller "
"på en stor skärm. Ingen kostnad."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The colour of the fps box's text: 20 colours, each with an outline so it reads on any picture "
"(black on white = dark text, white outline). Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Färgen på fps-räknarens text: 20 färger, var och en med kontur så den syns på alla bilder (svart "
"på vitt = mörk text, vit kontur). Platt och VR. Ingen kostnad."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How bright the fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = the colour as it is, lower dims the text (the "
"outline stays) toward black. Use it to tone the counter down at night or in the headset. Flat and "
"VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Hur ljus fps-räknaren är, 10 - 100 %: 100 = färgen som den är, lägre dämpar texten (konturen "
"finns kvar) mot svart. Använd för att dämpa räknaren på natten eller i headsetet. Platt och VR. "
"Ingen kostnad."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How see-through the whole fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = solid, lower fades the text AND its black "
"outline together, so a dimmed box does not turn into a black blob. Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Hur genomskinlig hela fps-räknaren är, 10 - 100 %: 100 = solid, lägre tonar ut texten OCH den "
"svarta konturen tillsammans, så en dämpad räknare inte blir en svart klump. Platt och VR. Ingen "
"kostnad."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the fps box floats, 0.30 - 3.00 m. It keeps the same "
"size in your view at every distance; only the depth changes. Put it near the depth you look at to "
"read it without refocusing. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Endast VR, därför grå i platt. Hur långt bort fps-räknaren svävar, 0,30 - 3,00 m. Den behåller "
"samma storlek i din syn på alla avstånd; bara djupet ändras. Sätt den nära djupet du tittar på "
"för att läsa utan att fokusera om. Ingen kostnad."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What goes into dlaa_inject.log: off = nothing; errors = failures only (default); warnings = + "
"problems worked around; info = + start-up and changes; debug = + statistics, and debug also runs "
"the GPU timers and the CPU profiler."
msgstr ""
"Vad som hamnar i dlaa_inject.log: av = inget; fel = bara fel (standard); varningar = + kringgådda "
"problem; info = + start och ändringar; felsökning = + statistik, och felsökning kör även "
"GPU-timrarna och CPU-profileraren."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The language of this menu. auto = the game's language (default); Left / Right picks another one. "
"Linux / Proton: Chinese, Japanese and Korean need their fonts installed, see the README. A "
"lang\\<code>.po file next to the DLL wins, for your own fixes. Save keeps it. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Menyns språk. auto = spelets språk (standard); vänster / höger väljer ett annat. Linux / Proton: "
"kinesiska, japanska och koreanska kräver sina typsnitt, se README. En lang\\<code>.po bredvid "
"DLL:en vinner, för egna rättelser. Spara behåller den. Ingen kostnad."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Every hotkey of this menu, one line per action, with its keyboard key and controller button. "
"Right opens the list; pick an action with Right, then press the new key or wheel button. Saved to "
"dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"Varje kortkommando i den här menyn, en rad per åtgärd, med tangentbordstangent och kontrollknapp. "
"Höger öppnar listan; välj en åtgärd med höger och tryck sedan den nya tangenten eller "
"rattknappen. Sparas direkt i dlaa.ini."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Writes everything shown here into dlaa.ini (settings, and the panel / fps box positions once you "
"moved them), keeping every other line. Do it once you like what you see, or the changes are gone "
"at the next start. Mode saves itself."
msgstr ""
"Skriver allt som visas här till dlaa.ini (inställningar och panelens / fps-räknarens positioner "
"när du flyttat dem), alla andra rader bevaras. Gör det när du är nöjd, annars är ändringarna "
"borta vid nästa start. Läget sparar sig självt."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Puts every setting in this menu back to how the mod ships (model, sharpen, texture sharpness, "
"DLAA area, motion, mirrors, profile, panel, fps box, turbo, foveated, frame rate, logging), live "
"and in dlaa.ini, keeping your hotkeys and every other line."
msgstr ""
"Återställer varje inställning i den här menyn till hur modden levereras (modell, skärpning, "
"texturskärpa, DLAA-yta, rörelse, speglar, profil, panel, fps-räknare, turbo, foveated, "
"bildfrekvens, loggning), live och i dlaa.ini; dina kortkommandon och alla andra rader bevaras."

